{
  "name": "owner",
  "description": "The account that owns sessions, coffees and a group: pass master@cata.test. Where it is also the super-admin of the local environment it sees every session (the \"admin\" states). Cup pages run last (phase 1): opening one queues a first save that the tool blocks, and the app then shows a \"pending drafts\" badge on later screens.",
